==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|вкусъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|cu|въкоусъ}}, ultimately from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*kusъ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-вкус.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-вкус.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|adj=вкусово́й}}

# [[taste]] (one of the sensations produced by the tongue)
#: {{uxi|ru|[[по вку́су]]|[[to taste]] {{gloss|when adding spices}}}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[на вкус и цвет това́рищей нет]]|q=proverb|[[there's no accounting for taste]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[о вку́сах не спо́рят]]|q=proverb|[[every man to his taste]]}}
# [[flavour]]/[[flavor]], [[fancy]]
# [[style]], [[manner]]
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1904|author=w:ru:Лев Толстой<t:{{w|Leo Tolstoy}}>|title=w:ru:[[Хаджи-Мурат (повесть)|Хаджи-Мурат]]|chapter=s:ru:[[Хаджи-Мурат_(Толстой)/X|X]]|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=Louise and Aylmer Maude|title2=s:en:[[Hadji Murad/10|Hadji Murat]]|location2=|publisher2=|year2=1912|page2=|pageurl2=
|text=В то́т же день, ве́чером, в но́вом, в восто́чном '''вку́се''' отде́ланном теа́тре шла италья́нская о́пера.|t=That even an Italian opera was performed at the new theater, which was decorated in Oriental '''style'''.}}

